sequenceDiagram
  participant Mobile
  participant API
  participant Cache as Permitted local route cache
  actor User
  Mobile->>API: Request route / update
  API--x Mobile: Network or provider unavailable
  Mobile->>Cache: Check unexpired permitted route
  alt Route cache valid
    Cache-->>Mobile: Cached route and last step
    Mobile-->>User: Clearly announce GPS-only offline mode
  else No valid route
    Cache-->>Mobile: No usable route
    Mobile-->>User: Explain limitation, do not invent directions
  end
